From: =?UTF-8?q?Enrico=20B=C3=BChler?= <enrico.buehler@unom.io>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] shaders: site 4:2:0 capture chroma on the left column

cs_rgb_to_nv12 and cs_rgb_to_p010 average each 2x2 luma block, which puts
the chroma sample at the block centre (H.273 chroma location 1). H.264,
HEVC and AV1 decoders that see no chroma location assume type 0, sited on
the left luma column, and AV1 has no way to signal centre siting at all.
Every colour edge in a PipeWire capture then decodes shifted half a luma
pixel to the right.

Filter [1 2 1] across the left column and its neighbours over both rows.
The chroma now sits where decoders put it, and the extra tap also
low-passes horizontally before the 2x decimation.
---
 src/shaders/cs_rgb_to_nv12.comp | 6 +++++-
 src/shaders/cs_rgb_to_p010.comp | 6 +++++-
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/shaders/cs_rgb_to_nv12.comp b/src/shaders/cs_rgb_to_nv12.comp
index 18844248..a706aea3 100644
--- a/src/shaders/cs_rgb_to_nv12.comp
+++ b/src/shaders/cs_rgb_to_nv12.comp
@@ -63,7 +63,11 @@ void main() {
       sampleLayer(0, vec2(luma_uv.x + offset_table[3].x, luma_uv.y + offset_table[3].y)).rgb,
     };
 
-    vec3 avg_color = (color[0] + color[1] + color[2] + color[3]) / 4.0f;
+    // Left-sited chroma (H.273 type 0, what decoders assume): [1 2 1] across columns x-1..x+1.
+    vec3 left_top = sampleLayer(0, vec2(luma_uv.x - 1.0f, luma_uv.y)).rgb;
+    vec3 left_bottom = sampleLayer(0, vec2(luma_uv.x - 1.0f, luma_uv.y + 1.0f)).rgb;
+    vec3 avg_color = (left_top + 2.0f * color[0] + color[1] +
+                      left_bottom + 2.0f * color[2] + color[3]) / 8.0f;
     vec2 uv = applyColorMatrix(avg_color, u_outputCTM).yz;
     imageStore(dst_chroma, chroma_uv, vec4(uv, 0.0f, 1.0f));
 
diff --git a/src/shaders/cs_rgb_to_p010.comp b/src/shaders/cs_rgb_to_p010.comp
index ed6ea1c3..04cab51b 100644
--- a/src/shaders/cs_rgb_to_p010.comp
+++ b/src/shaders/cs_rgb_to_p010.comp
@@ -70,7 +70,11 @@ void main() {
       fetchLayer(luma_uv + offset_table[3]),
     };
 
-    vec3 avg_color = (color[0] + color[1] + color[2] + color[3]) / 4.0f;
+    // Left-sited chroma (H.273 type 0, what decoders assume): [1 2 1] across columns x-1..x+1.
+    vec3 left_top = fetchLayer(luma_uv + vec2(-1, 0));
+    vec3 left_bottom = fetchLayer(luma_uv + vec2(-1, 1));
+    vec3 avg_color = (left_top + 2.0f * color[0] + color[1] +
+                      left_bottom + 2.0f * color[2] + color[3]) / 8.0f;
     vec3 uv = toCodes(vec4(avg_color, 1.0f) * u_outputCTM);
     imageStore(dst_chroma, chroma_uv, vec4(uv.yz, 0.0f, 1.0f));
 
